{"ID":"20240118151103-parmhfc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151103-parmhfc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151103-parmhfc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151103-z1vkzro\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240202082055-f7aecn6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122140201-yiquxmj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:34,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:34\u0026#125;","title":"229燕屎230天鼠屎","type":"doc","updated":"20240202082101"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151103-z1vkzro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151103-z1vkzro","updated":"20240122140138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"燕屎"}]},{"ID":"20240122140138-l1vvhwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140138-l1vvhwm","updated":"20240122140142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，平，有毒。治蛊毒，鬼疰，逐不祥邪气，破五癃，利小便。生高山平谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140142-hd0aiab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140142-hd0aiab"}},{"ID":"20240122140151-ry88fxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140151-ry88fxu","updated":"20240122140151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"天鼠屎"}]},{"ID":"20240122140152-sws85hi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140152-sws85hi","updated":"20240122140200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，寒，无毒。治面痈肿，皮肤洒洒时痛，腹中血气，破寒热积聚，除惊悸。生山谷。一名鼠法，一名石肝。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122140200-lc6u5he","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140200-lc6u5he"}},{"ID":"20240122140201-yiquxmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122140201-yiquxmj","updated":"20240202082101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个229跟230一个是燕屎一个是天鼠屎哦，这个呢，现在很少用，哦诸位看看就好了，你如果跑到那边开个燕屎两钱，也找不到。"}]},{"ID":"20240202082055-f7aecn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202082055-f7aecn6"}}]}